  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing gender mainstreaming in and through education in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will provide better support to member states to operationalize UNESCO&#x2019;s Strategy for Gender Equality in and through Education 2019-2025.

Additional efforts are needed to achieve gender equality in and through education in West Africa. Major needs include raising awareness, building capacity, and implementing hands-on tools for gender mainstreaming in order to provide better support to member states. At time, most resources at UNESCO on gender mainstreaming are in English and not contextualized to the West Africa context. 

Key activities include adapting existing gender mainstreaming tools and developing new ones as required, and training staff and relevant beneficiaries to implement the tool through at least two ongoing projects.</narrative>
  </description>
